cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this design, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Citrus Harvesting Robot: an open, low-cost 3D-printed tracked robot platform for selective orange harvesting"
abstract: >-
  Open-hardware design of a low-cost tracked mobile robot for selective,
  single-fruit orange harvesting, organised as a layered IoT architecture
  (perception, network, processing and application). Includes the FreeCAD
  source model, printable STL files, assembly guides, bill of materials and
  a design log of the prototype iterations.
